Program -> Declarations EOF
Declarations -> Declaration Declarations | EPS
Declaration -> Type IDENTIFICADOR DeclarationRest | IDENTIFICADOR LPAREN Parameters RPAREN Block
DeclarationRest -> LPAREN Parameters RPAREN Block | Initializer PONTO_VIRGULA
Type -> INT | DOUBLE | BOOL | CHAR | STRING_TYPE
Initializer -> AssignmentOperator Expression | EPS
AssignmentOperator -> IGUAL | ATRIBUI
Parameters -> Parameter ParametersTail | EPS
ParametersTail -> VIRGULA Parameter ParametersTail | EPS
Parameter -> Type IDENTIFICADOR
Block -> ABRE_CHAVE Statements FECHA_CHAVE
Statements -> Statement Statements | EPS
Statement -> Type IDENTIFICADOR Initializer PONTO_VIRGULA | IDENTIFICADOR IdentifierStatement | IF LPAREN Expression RPAREN Block ElsePart | WHILE LPAREN Expression RPAREN Block | RETURN ReturnValue PONTO_VIRGULA | Block
IdentifierStatement -> AssignmentOperator Expression PONTO_VIRGULA | LPAREN Arguments RPAREN PONTO_VIRGULA
ElsePart -> ELSE Block | EPS
ReturnValue -> Expression | EPS
Arguments -> Expression ArgumentsTail | EPS
ArgumentsTail -> VIRGULA Expression ArgumentsTail | EPS
Expression -> Equality
Equality -> Relational EqualityTail
EqualityTail -> EqualityOperator Relational EqualityTail | EPS
EqualityOperator -> IGUAL_IGUAL | DIFERENTE
Relational -> Additive RelationalTail
RelationalTail -> RelationalOperator Additive RelationalTail | EPS
RelationalOperator -> MENOR | MENOR_IGUAL | MAIOR | MAIOR_IGUAL
Additive -> Multiplicative AdditiveTail
AdditiveTail -> AdditiveOperator Multiplicative AdditiveTail | EPS
AdditiveOperator -> MAIS | MENOS
Multiplicative -> Unary MultiplicativeTail
MultiplicativeTail -> MultiplicativeOperator Unary MultiplicativeTail | EPS
MultiplicativeOperator -> VEZES | DIVIDIR
Unary -> NAO Unary | MENOS Unary | MAIS Unary | Primary
Primary -> IDENTIFICADOR CallSuffix | INTEGER | FLOAT | BOOLEANO | CHAR_LITERAL | STRING | LPAREN Expression RPAREN
CallSuffix -> LPAREN Arguments RPAREN | EPS
